<title>BOTSWANA: Botswana Aug consumer inflation rises 9.9 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Botswana Aug consumer inflation rises 9.9 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>GABORONE 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Botswana's all-items consumer price index increased 0.6 percent in August from July, bringing the year-on-year increase to 9.9 percent, the Central Statistics Office said.</p>
<p>			  August 1996	 July 1996	August 1995</p>
<p>Yr/Yr pct change	9.9		  10.4	     10.5</p>
<p>All-items index     173.0		 172.0	    157.4</p>
<p>(Base: November 1991 = 100)</p>
<p>-- Gaborone newsroom +267 347182</p>
